-- clone is not defined for receiver side (negative tests)
-- These must be ill-formed / ill-kinded

-- Receiver side cannot appear as clone argument
-- clone : **?Int -> (**?Int, **?Int)   -- ill-typed: clone only defined for **!a

-- Affine sender cannot be used as unrestricted (*C)
-- **!Int cannot inhabit *C

-- Affine types are not session types
-- **!Int is not of kind 1S — cannot appear where 1S expected
-- **?Int is not of kind 1S

-- Affine receiver is not a shared channel
-- **?Int ≠ *?Int